{"meta":{"id":"tt5952332","type":"movie","name":"Amanda Knox","imdb_id":"tt5952332","description":"Documental sobre el famoso caso de Amanda Knox, una joven estudiante norteamericana de la Universidad de Peruggia, Italia que en el 2007 fue acusada de asesinar a su compañera de piso, la británica Meredith Kercher. Knox fue acusada junto dos jóvenes, ambos conocidos de la víctima, su novio Raffaele Sollecito y un joven de Costa de Marfil Rudy Guede. Detenidos los tres, se inició así uno de los juicios con más repercusión internacional de los últimos tiempos.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt5952332.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5DfhvCAWMcLLhfATTa1KuoRzoEz.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wirZ4jARPSra4BxUVRO0zwi2M3.png","genres":["Documental","Crimen"],"releaseInfo":"2016","released":"2016-09-10T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"92 min","imdbRating":"6.9","country":"Denmark","cast":["Amanda Knox","Raffaele Sollecito","Rudy Guede"],"director":["Rod Blackhurst","Brian McGinn"],"writer":["Matthew Hamachek","Brian McGinn"],"trailers":[{"source":"mRLt2xBpQbQ","type":"Trailer","name":"Amanda Knox | Official Trailer [HD] | Netflix","ytId":"mRLt2xBpQbQ","lang":"en"},{"source":"-ld-6Tz6bIg","type":"Trailer","name":"Amanda Knox (2016) HD Trailer 2","ytId":"-ld-6Tz6bIg","lang":"en"},{"source":"PofQhX_sPBY","type":"Trailer","name":"Amanda Knox (2016) HD Trailer","ytId":"PofQhX_sPBY","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"mRLt2xBpQbQ","title":"Amanda Knox | Official Trailer [HD] | Netflix"},{"ytId":"-ld-6Tz6bIg","title":"Amanda Knox (2016) HD Trailer 2"},{"ytId":"PofQhX_sPBY","title":"Amanda Knox (2016) HD Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"6.9","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt5952332"},{"name":"Documental","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Documental"},{"name":"Crimen","category":"Genr